[{"title":"自龙泉乘车由双峰至香岩寺","author":"王志鳌","text":"西阁踟蹰别，出门趣更真。\n云飞知送客，花笑欲留人。\n径转泉声细，车停鸟语新。\n遥看仙境出，掩映别嶙峋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12174,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"香岩寺值雨","author":"王志鳌","text":"空山四月乍惊秋，晓启疏窗满目幽。\n玉塔初看云影重，龙池旋听水声浮。\n峰排四面青逾出，树列千重翠欲流。\n本是龙眠著色画，淋漓又与米家侔。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12175,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"普安观","author":"王致礼","text":"攀枝踏石陟层巅，斗室悠然别有天。\n趺坐片时心顿静，世人漫道我逃禅。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12176,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"香岩寺","author":"杨时华","text":"著鞭不让众人先，鸟引花迎入洞天。\n鹦鹉钵盂皆胜迹，谁云此地胜龙泉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12177,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"纪游","author":"王浩","text":"海上蓬莱昔已游，千山登眺又从头。\n龙泉缥渺云间住，佛顶岧峣天上游。\n如水月明山作岛，凌空梵宇蜃为楼。\n此中名胜侔东鲁，特为精蓝十日留。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12178,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"纪游","author":"徐培基","text":"山海雄关外，栖迟数十秋。\n登仙闻白鹤，揽胜逐清流。\n石上松谁著，窗前画不收。\n几朝游赏地，回想尚夷犹。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12179,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"纪游","author":"李玖","text":"萍踪游览此追陪，故国他乡孰胜哉。\n趵突泉从平地起，濯缨水自半山来。\n奇松触石穿松窟，鸟道登峰拜佛台。\n曾忆髫龄瞻泰岱，依稀隔海共崔嵬。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12180,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"书汪氏双节传后","author":"王尔烈","text":"二女同居多异志，两贤相遇真家瑞。\n家瑞偏逢变坎坷，贤女空悲共憔悴。\n汪君同室曰王徐，浙水清门著节义。\n自昔之子号宜家，厥后良人厄远地。\n瞻望母兮目岂瞑，哀弱子兮孤谁寄。\n庄姜戴妫无猜嫌，赵姬叔隗均礼谊。\n含悽且作未亡人，戮力同肩未了事。\n风雨冥冥虓虎惊，篱壁萧萧魑魅肆。\n凛冽冰霜足禦侮，殷勤针黹还供匮。\n冬夜夏日寒暑长，机筐书箧无时置。\n高堂终年子有成，地下报君妾无愧。\n贤哉患难有同心，嗟乎传闻为酸鼻。\n福堂应以阴骘酬，弱骨何必鬼神忌。\n齐年双嫠穴同归，百死孤生空血泪。\n闺中婴臼岂为名，身后鼎牲匪我思。\n君恩逮下靡有遗，孝子显亲无弗至。\n吾为贤者叹馀生，何以报之为良吏。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12181,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过医巫闾山诗","author":"王尔烈","text":"天府有崇山，医闾关外壮。\n长白遥拱挹，两京此屏障。\n管领西来蜂，朝东各献状。\n若崩角稽首，后先不相让。\n乃知开辟初，已定今之王。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12182,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题画","author":"缪公恩","text":"茅屋两三间，云横千仞山。\n西风下残照，烟水片帆还。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12183,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日游冯氏废园","author":"缪公恩","text":"溪水环村舍，门迎杜若洲。\n清风三径晓，黄叶一庭秋。\n霜度征鸿远，墙吟促织幽。\n故园何处是，引起别离愁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12184,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"溪上","author":"缪公恩","text":"霜气横秋木叶残，夕阳雁影下芦滩。\n茅堂寂寂人高卧，门外云深水自寒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12185,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春日郊游","author":"缪公恩","text":"出城三四里，茅舍几人家。\n踏屐探幽径，敲门问落花。\n风前村店酒，雨后小姑茶。\n处处多春涨，桃源拟泛槎。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12186,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春闺","author":"缪公恩","text":"冷雨凄凄独掩扉，无言脉脉望春归。\n桃花柳絮关情思，莫逐东风一片飞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12187,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"月下闻笛","author":"缪公恩","text":"何处吹羌笛，萧然到草亭。\n烟轻笼淡月，云薄带疏星。\n一曲催梅落，三秋折柳青。\n援琴方欲和，雁阵下寒汀。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12188,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"舟泊焦山作","author":"缪公恩","text":"晴光明素镜，皎月海门浮。\n蜃气朝成雾，龙吟夜入秋。\n十年常作客，万里一维舟。\n凭吊蜗庐叟，低回意欲留。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12189,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春闺","author":"缪公恩","text":"千树桃花映粉楼，东风万点逐波流。\n落红不是题诗叶，愁向人间寄得不。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12190,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"水阁纳凉同董均可步管丈秋崖元韵","author":"缪公恩","text":"一泓秋涨半池荷，小榭临流起细波。\n水气潜随花气散，蝉声远杂树声多。\n残霞影落连朱槛，新霁烟深锁翠萝。\n纳爽不知天竟晚，已看高阁转银河。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12191,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"前题答董均可","author":"缪公恩","text":"小阁清幽绕芰荷，生香十里漾层波。\n雨侵石壁吟蛩少，风拂寒林野茧多。\n断港残晖留几榻，平桥衰柳伴藤萝。\n长歌久出巴人下，一曲淇原隔大河。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12192,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寒月","author":"缪公恩","text":"仙宇萧骚转玉绳，西风淅淅夜澄澄。\n光飞碧瓦千家雪，影挂银河一片冰。\n潮落海天秋气敛，烟销云汉露华凝。\n嫦娥罢舞开妆镜，霜重霓裳力不胜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12193,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读张瀛客先生遗稿","author":"缪公恩","text":"炉冶群言自一家，夜台萧索两年赊。\n古梅雅抱凭谁赏，宝剑寒芒空自嗟。\n手迹只馀书上草，心思犹灿笔头花。\n遥怜麦饭青松树，黯淡残阳噪晚鸦。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12194,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"登辛峰亭","author":"缪公恩","text":"孤亭峭立压嵯峨，尺五青霄近可摩。\n地涌湖光飞匹练，云连海气锁双螺。\n珠襦香散红颜冷，宝剑虹藏碧草多。\n欲问遗踪何处是，清风飒飒拂藤萝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12195,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夜坐","author":"缪公恩","text":"一天风雨暗雕檐，古鼎香残细细添。\n官酿初开陶令酒，山园小熟戴公柑。\n贪看菊影频移榻，为待蟾光不下?。\n谯鼓沈沈乡梦杳，客窗新韵几回拈。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12196,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"漫吟","author":"缪公恩","text":"梧桐瑟瑟竹萧萧，閒捲湘?坐寂寥。\n碎响何来清彻耳，半窗疏雨打芭蕉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12197,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"游虎邱","author":"缪公恩","text":"附郭名山著虎邱，繁华未始掩清幽。\n画船十里联红袖，歌管千家起翠楼。\n云气自来萦塔影，岚光终古落溪流。\n讲台不复生公坐，顽石何时再点头。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12198,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"立夏前偶成","author":"缪公恩","text":"入夏馀三日，春光有几何。\n鸟声宿雨少，花瓣落风多。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12199,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"舟行湖中","author":"缪公恩","text":"万里轻舠返，平湖正暮秋。\n沙汀来雁阵，荻港动渔舟。\n山影天边淡，村烟水际浮。\n息心争席后，倚棹狎群鸥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12200,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"江中","author":"缪公恩","text":"镜里行人画里舟，篷窗深锁半江秋。\n气吞巫峡三千里，声到蓬壶十二楼。\n山隔天光迷两脚，日蒸霞影破云头。\n布帆风利难停泊，未许金焦汗漫游。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12201,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"环翠楼闻篴","author":"缪公恩","text":"草短沙平雁下滩，小楼初夜凭阑干。\n月明何处吹渔篴，秋水梅花一味寒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12202,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"翠峰寺","author":"缪公恩","text":"古刹依山竹绕楼，岚光飞黛结松楸。\n老僧不解谈经偈，但向青峦说石头。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12203,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"黄浦江待渡","author":"缪公恩","text":"出没江豚拜碧澜，篷窗薄暮倚阑干。\n怒潮忽向天边起，一夜涛声枕上寒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12204,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"太湖怀古 其一","author":"缪公恩","text":"扁舟泛五湖，倚棹望姑苏。\n嗟哉伍相国，不及范大夫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12205,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"太湖怀古 其二","author":"缪公恩","text":"扁舟泛五湖，倚棹望越都。\n嗟哉吴西施，不及秦罗敷。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12206,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"纳凉","author":"缪公恩","text":"平池倒影落霞红，碎锦残花入镜中。\n小榭临流窗四面，袭人衣袖紫薇风。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12207,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"登楼","author":"缪公恩","text":"落叶萧条万井秋，碧云天外水东流。\n苍烟古木寒鸦乱，野径残阳旅客愁。\n千里音书悲雁断，十年踪迹感萍浮。\n擎杯欲醉何曾醉，惆怅西风独倚楼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12208,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄贾丈汉庭 其一","author":"缪公恩","text":"吴淞烟水隔伊人，几度西楼望月轮。\n不信陇头无驿使，也应寄我一枝春。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12209,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄贾丈汉庭 其二","author":"缪公恩","text":"今岁山梅特早开，北枝已是点冰苔。\n墙阴一树封残雪，笋脆芹香待客来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12210,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送别友人","author":"缪公恩","text":"海风吹雨满山城，小艇蒲帆送客行。\n花落沙堤春草绿，水深野港暮潮平。\n一樽酒尽难言别，千里人归太瘦生。\n北雁有书须远寄，莫教江树锁离情。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12211,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"途中","author":"缪公恩","text":"天外青山隐夕阳，烟波缥缈忆江乡。\n白云无路归鸿鹄，海燕翩翩底事忙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12212,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"野店","author":"缪公恩","text":"柳浪青青麦浪黄，山风吹雨湿衣裳。\n微尘不起茆檐洁，野枣花开树树香。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12213,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄怀友人","author":"缪公恩","text":"碧空银汉锁天津，万里西风独惘神。\n愿诉愁心付明月，殷勤寄与倚栏人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12214,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"闱中作","author":"缪公恩","text":"碧汉无声万里清，浩然风露夜三更。\n南天极目空相忆，明远楼头月正明。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12215,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过玉蝀桥","author":"缪公恩","text":"御池秋水碧潾潾，万树迎风拥翠尘。\n蓦地天香来水面，此身应是月中人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12216,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"九月七日作","author":"缪公恩","text":"弓月悬星汉，寒光落万家。\n蛩吟清露重，雁带碧天斜。\n父母怜游子，关山感物华。\n徘徊明镜里，举首望浮槎。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12217,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"饮酒","author":"缪公恩","text":"春暮发轻舟，旋惊报九秋。\n西风吹落木，寒月下高楼。\n空负千金剑，难销万斛愁。\n谁家有美酒，不惜紫貂裘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12218,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"远望","author":"缪公恩","text":"青山断处白云遮，山外遥空雁阵斜。\n万里西风吹落叶，不吹客梦到天涯。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12219,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晓至赵北口","author":"缪公恩","text":"短烛烧残马暂停，渡头村舍户犹扃。\n鸡声警露鸣高树，雁阵排空下远汀。\n两岸芦花飞白雪，半湖秋水带寒星。\n凭栏欲济无舟楫，目极遥山一抹青。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12220,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"吊谷城项王冢","author":"缪公恩","text":"谷城山下路苍苍，独对高峰吊愤王。\n当日拔山矜意气，祇今残陇牧牛羊。\n风声悲似骓嘶月，岚色寒犹剑吐芒。\n空养全锋誇得鹿，长陵秋草几斜阳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12221,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"道中","author":"缪公恩","text":"敝裘不耐晓来凉，风捲黄沙啸白杨。\n极目遥天空怅望，马嘶声里又残阳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12222,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夜坐","author":"缪公恩","text":"雁断秋空一纸书，旅人惆怅意何如。\n夜深自起当轩坐，明月萧萧落碧梧。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12223,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"谒和圣柳下惠墓","author":"缪公恩","text":"展季坟前歧路多，村童笑指此间过。\n士存抔土争王贵，人沐遗风识圣和。\n柳外轻烟归牧笛，洲边细雨隐渔蓑。\n双槐墓道盘根大，十万龙蛇效护呵。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12224,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"途间怀洪稚存书壁","author":"缪公恩","text":"乡关迢递阻离思，冀马南风鸟北枝。\n嗟我又来黄叶路，忆君同听白杨时。\n凉云落照三秋别，野草平沙万里悲。\n他日花骢重此过，休忘索和壁间诗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12225,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"途中二律 其一","author":"缪公恩","text":"茆店鸡初唱，长堤策马过。\n水明残月出，霜重晓寒多。\n夹道迷荒草，连天涌白波。\n敝裘谁补缀，萧瑟奈秋何。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12226,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"途中二律 其二","author":"缪公恩","text":"羁迟踰半载，游子意如何。\n清梦白云远，征鞍黄叶多。\n万山飞晓月，平野落秋河。\n古道无相识，愁心寄素娥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12227,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春怨","author":"缪公恩","text":"和风吹絮夕阳西，嫩柳千条一色齐。\n何事东君归去早，落红满径子规啼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12228,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"广陵竹枝词","author":"缪公恩","text":"从来洋子桥头水，不向江都城外流。\n愿诉潮神与风伯，殷勤为我送郎舟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12229,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"翁仲","author":"缪公恩","text":"剑佩衣冠恰俨然，昂藏尽日对苍烟。\n不言浑似三缄后，僵立何曾一步前。\n墓道草深无麦饭，纸灰风散落榆钱。\n牧人来往谁相问，任遣牛羊陇下眠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12230,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"舟中远望","author":"缪公恩","text":"极目青青麦陇齐，遥空山锁碧云低。\n一天春水江豚拜，万树垂杨杜宇啼。\n怪底愁心偏酒醉，缘何燕子入舟栖。\n计来旬日才瓜步，未得扬帆日又西。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12231,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"扬州 其一","author":"缪公恩","text":"自古扬州明月多，我来风雨锁嫦娥。\n桥边阁子谁家笛，短调偏吹折柳歌。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12232,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"扬州 其二","author":"缪公恩","text":"洋子江潮向夕平，画樯粉黛竞春行。\n何人廿四桥头立，折取琼花贮玉瓶。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12233,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"途中","author":"缪公恩","text":"策马拂征裳，微风料峭凉。\n月残人影淡，露重枣花香。\n已是经旬别，徒劳寸结肠。\n夜来茆屋里，清梦绕华堂。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12234,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"乞活城","author":"缪公恩","text":"铁甲雕戈委战尘，将军一败弃君亲。\n孤城乞活今安在，何似田横五百人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12235,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"督亢亭","author":"缪公恩","text":"竟将督亢入秦庭，太子宁知事不成。\n丽室已随流水去，孤亭犹有暮烟横。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12236,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过易水","author":"缪公恩","text":"易水潇潇日夜流，霜锋未发一身休。\n可怜怒叱燕丹去，不及秦州乌白头。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12237,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"都中见洪稚存 其一","author":"缪公恩","text":"燕市君居久，咄哉吾又来。\n半窗摊卷轴，小户远尘埃。\n病马谁相问，征衣母自裁。\n擎杯空怅望，偕子陟金台。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12238,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"都中见洪稚存 其二","author":"缪公恩","text":"半载离愁结，连床片刻消。\n暂邀青眼顾，又望白云遥。\n有梦都萧瑟，逢场亦寂寥。\n知君同此意，共忆路迢迢。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12239,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"书洪稚存近作后","author":"缪公恩","text":"乾坤大如此，晴雨又何奇。\n上下阅千古，荣枯任四时。\n云空飞逸气，月皎见清思。\n燕赵吾桑梓，能歌慷慨词。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12240,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"暮霁对月","author":"缪公恩","text":"残云归岫碧天空，碧瓦烟迷夕照红。\n雨气凉生深苑月，箫声吹彻小楼风。\n材惭燕市千金骨，梦绕吴门半夜钟。\n好向人□求玉斧，客星已傍广寒宫。","collection":"清","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12241,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寺中夜晴","author":"缪公恩","text":"云关寂寂锁幽昙，鸳瓦新晴色倍蓝。\n万里碧空收暮雨，满楼明月忆江南。\n桃笙梦醒闻街柝，竹寺钟疏落枕函。\n起看玉绳天外堕，绿窗槐影露华酣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12242,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"期洪稚存相过久不赴约因寄以诗","author":"缪公恩","text":"雨砌连朝长绿苔，摛词检字费宏才。\n子猷不放山阴棹，陆凯空劳驿使梅。\n月落屋梁思黯澹，酒醒冰簟起徘徊。\n嘱君好拂窗前几，明日携樽有客来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12243,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]